title: 3-ID notation could reify the five kinds of skg relationship.
pid: b19750cc-aaaa-4d4e-8a33-3d742622e2d7
body: |2-
  If there were a file for each of the five relations, the relationships using that relation would not have need their own file; they are defined by the relationships defining member atom, and referred to using three atom IDs: [relation atom, left atom, right atom].
